{"title":"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_10\">Problem 10</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 10\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The lines <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/9/859ccf4cd60c7bc6b8fa1afc9a42dc811a826d6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$L$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/b/dfb064112b6c94470339f6571f69d07afc1c024c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$K$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"19\" height=\"14\" /> are symmetric to each other with respect to the line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/1/741a74d86df899c10724dc2f80638f5e7f599194.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"46\" height=\"13\" />. If the equation of the line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/9/859ccf4cd60c7bc6b8fa1afc9a42dc811a826d6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$L$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/b/acba00f78e371cca4ecb9bc7f81b6e36ca589d08.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=ax+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"86\" height=\"18\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/a/1cae493c4855ca1cdd17c420fc6a97ebc082b591.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\neq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"42\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/4/b442f028b06d30bc44afbdbadaf91f22dc2b0dcf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b\\neq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"40\" height=\"17\" />, then the equation of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/b/dfb064112b6c94470339f6571f69d07afc1c024c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$K$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"19\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/d/96d0d9b1a98440ec868f0d03db629f9465942089.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"28\" height=\"11\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/d/89d62b6f909ee30a380ac1b18d637a092a242d85.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\dfrac{1}{a}x+b\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ -\\dfrac{1}{a}x+b\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\dfrac{1}{a}x-\\dfrac{b}{a}\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\dfrac{1}{a}x+\\dfrac{b}{a}\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\dfrac{1}{a}x-\\dfrac{b}{a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"612\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Recall that the reflection of any point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/4/e148d95e9a2349eff0d0ccd1ec50ace5fa25269b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(p, q)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" /> across the line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/0/a40fee4603b4536f856dde720ee499468ace443f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"46\" height=\"13\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/7/407c2808562871c2ca21951a21703f77b1d157bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(q, p)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />.  Therefore, any point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/4/e148d95e9a2349eff0d0ccd1ec50ace5fa25269b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(p, q)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" /> lies on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/9/859ccf4cd60c7bc6b8fa1afc9a42dc811a826d6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$L$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> if and only if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/7/407c2808562871c2ca21951a21703f77b1d157bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(q, p)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" /> lies on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/b/dfb064112b6c94470339f6571f69d07afc1c024c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$K$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"19\" height=\"14\" />. Therefore, any point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/0/0805f8acf15f0b5ef6b52bfac52610c823802f3c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(r, s)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"40\" height=\"20\" /> lies on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/b/dfb064112b6c94470339f6571f69d07afc1c024c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$K$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"19\" height=\"14\" /> if and only if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/f/c6f590c152dcf24aca4f7ed8c73c4da589819bf2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(s, r)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" /> lies on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/9/859ccf4cd60c7bc6b8fa1afc9a42dc811a826d6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$L$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" />, that is, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/1/3a15cd3f1160c1b92cf4f4d426f374e59937c57e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r=as+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"83\" height=\"16\" />.  Therefore, line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/b/dfb064112b6c94470339f6571f69d07afc1c024c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$K$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"19\" height=\"14\" /> has equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/4/904da7c56ea3228c1e29e43735a8067cf3f96184.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = ay + b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"86\" height=\"18\" />, and isolating <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/d/b7dc87a9ee4013db8f7cb1d533138327cb50f311.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = \\boxed{(\\textbf{E})\\ \\frac{1}{a}x-\\frac{b}{a}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"139\" height=\"50\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME\" title=\"1981 AHSME\">1981 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1981 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1981\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Pr